CORE libcxx
libcxx.cpp
--cpp17 --stdlib libc++
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ the base of the selected specialization: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ std::apply: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
^warning: ignoring
--
libc++'s std::tuple_size and std::apply (see test.desc): the conversion to
the base class and the static_asserts need the tuple<T...> partial
specialization with its base.  clang++ 18 with libc++ accepts the program.
